# Issue #9 Profile and Interests API Test Notes
## Purpose
This document records the manual verification steps for the backend implementation of issue #9.
## Scope
This issue currently covers:
- profile update with full name and email
- topic interests update
- topic list retrieval for frontend selection
This issue does not cover:
- availability schedule
- password change flow
- lab editing
